; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) records for the Support Case Helper.
;
; The Worker cannot publish these. Add them on a custom domain you control,
; then enable DNSSEC on that zone so validating resolvers return authenticated
; data. A *.workers.dev hostname cannot host _agents records.
;
; Replace example.com with the hostname that serves this Worker. The HTTPS
; target "." means the same name. alpn and port are required ServiceMode
; parameters. The TXT records carry the HTTP paths DNS-AID does not encode
; in a registered SvcParam yet.

$ORIGIN example.com.
$TTL 3600

_index._agents     3600 IN HTTPS 1 . alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_index._agents     3600 IN TXT   "url=https://example.com/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"

_mcp._agents       3600 IN HTTPS 1 . alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
_mcp._agents       3600 IN TXT   "path=/mcp"

_catalog._agents   3600 IN TXT   "url=https://example.com/.well-known/ai-catalog.json"
